# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for local `vite dev` / `wrangler pages dev`
# testing. @sveltejs/adapter-cloudflare's built-in platform-proxy support
# reads this file and injects it as `platform.env` — same mechanism
# wrangler itself uses, no extra config needed.
#
# AUTHENTIK_CLIENT_ID / AUTHENTIK_CLIENT_SECRET / AUTH_SESSION_SECRET: pull
# the real values the same way they're currently retrieved for local
# Astro-era `functions/` debugging.
#
# AUTH_SITE_ORIGIN: only needed to exercise the real OIDC round trip
# locally, and only works once http://localhost:5173/auth/callback is
# registered as a second redirect_uri on the Authentik OAuth2 provider (a
# separate, low-risk nix-repo change — see the migration plan). Leave unset
# to use the production origin (https://kleinbem.dev) as the default.
AUTHENTIK_CLIENT_ID=
AUTHENTIK_CLIENT_SECRET=
AUTH_SESSION_SECRET=
AUTH_SITE_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

RESEND_API_KEY=
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=
